sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Nexus
    participant Vault
    participant Supabase
    User->>Nexus: Select Supabase method and agent access
    alt Hosted MCP browser sign-in
        Nexus->>Supabase: Read protected resource and issuer metadata
        Nexus->>Supabase: Register instance OAuth client
        Nexus->>User: Open authorization URL
        User->>Supabase: Choose organization and consent
        Supabase->>Nexus: Instance callback with authorization code
        Nexus->>Supabase: Exchange code with PKCE
    else Personal access token
        User->>Nexus: Enter token and optional or required project reference
    end
    Nexus->>Vault: Store selected grant credential
    Nexus->>Supabase: MCP discovery or native project probe
    User->>Nexus: Set action permissions
    Nexus->>Nexus: Authorize agent run and selected grant
    Nexus->>Vault: Resolve selected invocation credential
    Nexus->>Supabase: Invoke permitted action
    Nexus->>Nexus: Record bounded result and audit
